msgctxt "SettingsTooltips::travel_core::cron_key"
msgid "One shared secret for every travel add-on's scheduled jobs — Travel Core, Novoton, Sphinx and Eurosite all authenticate against this. Leave it empty to keep the cron endpoints closed; generate a value before installing your crontab, and re-copy the cron commands whenever you change it."
