msgctxt "SettingsTooltips::travel_core::skip_cart_for"
msgid "The booking button of each ticked add-on says \"Continue booking\" and goes straight to checkout (the same checkout page for every add-on), skipping the cart page. Nothing ticked keeps the cart step for everyone."
